# DineDesk Restaurant Platform — Environment Configuration Template
# Zero-Config Mode: DineDesk runs with an in-memory data store by default.
# No database or environment variables are required to deploy on Vercel!

# (Optional) PostgreSQL Connection String:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dinedesk_db"

# (Optional) Application Environment:
NODE_ENV="production"
